8. In the result, the Civil Miscellaneous Appeal is disposed of in the following terms:
(a) The award passed in MCOP No.806 of 2015 by the Motor Accidents Claims Tribunal (Special Subordinate Court for MCOP Cases), Madurai is set aside;
(b) The matter is remanded back to the file of the Motor Accidents Claims Tribunal (Special Subordinate Court for MCOP Cases), Madurai and there shall be a direction to the legal heirs of the deceased claimant to file an application to substitute themselves in the place of the deceased claimant;
